data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":98,"item_id":"rs_0ddf3dd44ddfa07a016acaa732da94819480bee3b2deca310f","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Planning server implementation**\n\nI need to set up a static browser API server with a database and test integration, while avoiding XSS by using textContent. The project involves implementing a page route for a static app and handling API errors. I have to ensure persistence on test restarts, and I’m considering using a subprocess for testing. I’ll create an app module to expose the server and handle cleanup. The database will use default data, and I’ll set file limits while mapping secure routes."}

